#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:30
msgid "Common Fields"
msgstr "Campos comunes"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:32
msgid ""
"The first field is **Router Type**. The remaining fields are supplied by "
"that router provider, so a field shown for one type must not be assumed "
"to apply to another. Common provider fields include a router **Name**, "
"enabled state, Cloud or network integration, and integration-specific "
"location or gateway selections."
msgstr "El primer campo es **Router Type**. Los campos restantes los proporciona ese proveedor de router, por lo que un campo mostrado para un tipo no debe asumirse aplicable a otro. Los campos comunes del proveedor incluyen un **Nombre** de router, estado habilitado, Nube o integración de red, y selecciones de ubicación o gateway específicas de la integración."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:37
msgid ""
"**VM Network (OVS)** is the UI label for the ``openVSwitch`` type. "
"Despite appearing in the Routers list, it defines an Open vSwitch "
"bridging domain for an HVM cluster; it does not provide gateway, NAT, "
"firewall, DHCP, BGP, or static-routing functions."
msgstr "**VM Network (OVS)** es la etiqueta de la interfaz para el tipo ``openVSwitch``. A pesar de aparecer en la lista de Routers, define un dominio de conmutación Open vSwitch para un clúster HVM; no proporciona funciones de gateway, NAT, firewall, DHCP, BGP ni enrutamiento estático."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:39
msgid "VM Network (OVS) creation fields"
msgstr "Campos de creación de VM Network (OVS)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:43
msgid "Field"
msgstr "Campo"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:44
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descripción"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:45
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nombre"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:46
msgid "Required display name for the OVS network definition."
msgstr "Nombre para mostrar requerido para la definición de red OVS."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:47
msgid "Cluster"
msgstr "Clúster"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:48
msgid ""
"Required HVM cluster on which the OVS bridge or overlay is configured. "
"Only eligible clusters are offered."
msgstr "Clúster HVM requerido en el que se configura el puente o overlay OVS. Solo se ofrecen clústeres elegibles."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:49
msgid "Enable Overlay"
msgstr "Habilitar overlay"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:50
msgid ""
"Selects an overlay network across cluster hosts. When clear, configure a "
"bridge and port instead."
msgstr "Selecciona una red overlay entre los hosts del clúster. Si está desmarcado, configure un puente y un puerto en su lugar."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:51
msgid "OVS Bridge Name"
msgstr "Nombre del puente OVS"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:52
msgid ""
"Existing bridge on the selected cluster for a non-overlay network. Select"
" the create option to expose **New OVS Bridge Name**."
msgstr "Puente existente en el clúster seleccionado para una red sin overlay. Seleccione la opción de creación para exponer **New OVS Bridge Name**."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:53
msgid "New OVS Bridge Name"
msgstr "Nuevo nombre del puente OVS"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:54
msgid ""
"Required name when creating a bridge rather than selecting an existing "
"one."
msgstr "Nombre requerido al crear un puente en lugar de seleccionar uno existente."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:55
msgid "Port Name"
msgstr "Nombre del puerto"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:56
msgid ""
"Required host network interface attached to a newly created non-overlay "
"bridge."
msgstr "Interfaz de red del host requerida conectada a un puente sin overlay recién creado."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:57
msgid "Overlay Net Interface"
msgstr "Interfaz de red overlay"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:58
msgid ""
"Required cluster interface carrying overlay traffic when **Enable "
"Overlay** is selected."
msgstr "Interfaz del clúster requerida que transporta tráfico overlay cuando se selecciona **Enable Overlay**."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:59
msgid "Overlay Net Port"
msgstr "Puerto de red overlay"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:60
msgid "Required UDP overlay port. The current form defaults to ``4789``."
msgstr "Puerto UDP overlay requerido. El formulario actual tiene ``4789`` como valor predeterminado."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:61
msgid "Overlay ID"
msgstr "ID de overlay"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:62
msgid "Required overlay network identifier."
msgstr "Identificador de red overlay requerido."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:63
msgid "CIDR"
msgstr "CIDR"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:64
msgid "Required overlay address range in CIDR notation."
msgstr "Rango de direcciones overlay requerido en notación CIDR."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:66
msgid ""
"The OVS type and these fields are HVM-cluster scoped. Other router types "
"expose provider-specific fields and capabilities; compare the form in the"
" running release with the corresponding integration guide before creating"
" or changing them."
msgstr "El tipo OVS y estos campos tienen alcance de clúster HVM. Otros tipos de router exponen campos y capacidades específicos del proveedor; compare el formulario en la versión en ejecución con la guía de integración correspondiente antes de crearlos o modificarlos."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:69
msgid "Provider-specific Router Fields"
msgstr "Campos de router específicos del proveedor"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:71
msgid ""
"The bundled documentation metadata does not establish a release-"
"independent field inventory for the NSX, OpenStack, Open Telekom, and "
"other integration-supplied Router forms. Their visible fields depend on "
"the selected integration, provider inventory, permissions, and product "
"release. The running Create Router form is authoritative for field "
"availability; a field or Router type absent from that form is not "
"documented as supported for that provider. Do not reuse the VM Network "
"(OVS) meanings for another Router type."
msgstr "Los metadatos de documentación incluidos no establecen un inventario de campos independiente de la versión para los formularios de Router suministrados por NSX, OpenStack, Open Telekom y otras integraciones. Sus campos visibles dependen de la integración seleccionada, el inventario del proveedor, los permisos y la versión del producto. El formulario Create Router en ejecución es la referencia autorizada para la disponibilidad de campos; un campo o tipo de Router ausente de ese formulario no está documentado como compatible para ese proveedor. No reutilice los significados de VM Network (OVS) para otro tipo de Router."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:74
msgid "Editing Existing Routers"
msgstr "Editing Existente Routers"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:77
msgid "Click on the pencil icon for the appropriate router"
msgstr "Click en el pencil ícono para el appropriate router"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:78
msgid "After editing router fields, click :guilabel:`SAVE`"
msgstr "Después de editing router campos, click :guilabel:`SAVE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:81
msgid "Deleting Existing Routers"
msgstr "Deleting Existente Routers"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:84
msgid "Click on the trash can icon for the appropriate router"
msgstr "Click en el trash puede ícono para el appropriate router"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers.rst:85
msgid "Acknowledge the pop-up banner ensuring you wish to delete the router"
msgstr "Acknowledge el pop-up banner ensuring you wish a eliminar el router"

